<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">VAGALATIA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa lya pili kwa Vagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Vag</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa lya pili kwa vanu va Vagalatia</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vagalatia</para>
  <para style="mt">Ulongocho</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiganulo kya Vagalatia kisimbilwe na Mnjagila Paulo, musula lya 1.1. Paulo akasimbile balua iyi kwa lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito muinyi lya Vagalati pagati cha chipindi cha myaka alobaini na nane mbaka amsini na saba, peababilwe Yesu. Yivecha Vagalatia vakali vakwikala mumwani weukali utavalwa na Valumi veugehe Galatia. Vakwimba sevakachele unofu Paulo akali kwiya peakali isimba baluwa iyi, yivecha akali mumwani va Efeso na Kolindo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo avasimbilie vanu vevamudikile Kilisito vonda Vayawudi na se Vayawudi kwa lipinga lya vanu vevamudikie Kilisito. Akasimbile baluwa iyi neke kulakilila mawulanicho ga udesi kuva vanu vevamudikile Kilisito vakang'ang'ilwe kufwata malagilicho ga Vayawudi kuhuma Lyagano lya Dahila hilo kudumula bina. Kukali na lipinga lya vanu mugati lya vanu vevamudikie Kilisito vevakemeliwe Yudaiza vene vakang'ang'ile kuva vanu vevamudikie Kilisito sevagehe Vayawudi vadumulwe bina. Kangi vakahiuchile hilo pakyanya lya umwimike va Paulo va kiunjagila. Paulo akatasile unjagila vake kwa kuhumulila njowo chake musula lya 1.11—2.14 na ayitasile Njowo Nofu kwa kuhumulila kuva ulowolo uwanukwa kwa kumdikila Yesu Kilisito musula lya 2.16, uwo ulowolwa uhumichwa na usanzi va Nguluvi na se gala gegigitwa na vanu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ivanga kusimba baluwa kwa kuvahungila lipinga lya vanu vevamudikie Kilisito lya ukoya Galatia musula lya 1.1-5.</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi Paulo ihumulila makani gake ga dahila neke kudima uwimike vake va kuwulanicha kuno iwonesa kuva akagechile kwikala kwa kulongochwa kwa malagilicho ila segamutangile musula lya 1.6—2.21.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambele ihumulila hilo natilo lya malagilicho na unemelo muulowolo musula lya 3-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi avalagilichile vonda kwikala unofu kwa vanu vevamudikile Kilisito musula lya 5.1—6.10.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo imalila kusimba baluwa lyake kwa kuvahungila na kuvasuka kuva vawiwuka kuva kugalambuchwa na Nguluvi kuvecha munu mumiya ndi ngiba hilo kuchumba malagilicho ga kwivala, ngita fila kudumula bina musula lya 6.11-18.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s">Baluwa lya Paulo kwa Vagalatia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Nene Paulo mnjagila yendikemeliwe na Nguluvi na sekwakuhaguliwa na vanu, ila kwa umwimike va Yesu Kilisito na va Nguluvi Daada yeamchulubuwe Yesu, <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />na lukolo vonda vevakali pamwi na nene tukugahungila mapinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito ukoya Galatia.<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Ndikumsuka Nguluvi daada na Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito avagavile usanzi na lutengamaso.<verse eid="GAL 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Ajihechile usembe kwakuva lya kuhecha sambi chetu neke apatile kutuwokola kuhuma mu inyi ugu va ino muwofu, savasava na lukelo lwake mwene Nguluvi na Daada vetu. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Nguluvi ndi mkomi ing'ang'wa kunjumwa mbepali na mbepali! Ndakyene.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwihela Njowo nofu chingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Ndiduduvala hilo, kwa chipindi kidodo hela kichumbile, nyenye mukumuleka Nguluvi kisatu yeavakemele kwa usanzi va Kilisito na mufwata njowo nofu cha udesi. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Ila kuhela, “Njowo nofu cha udesi,” Undakyene ndi kuva kugehe na vanu vevakuvahanganya nyenye, kangi avo vasaka kusedusa Njowo nofu cha Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Ila kwa nefwe awu ndumindumi yeahumile kuluhano ikwacha na kuvadalikila njowo nofu yingi, sechiwana na Njowo nofu chetuvadalikile nefwe, munu uyo akatoliwe! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Ngita petulongile daha, nondee ndilonga kangi, ngita munu yeyonda akuvadalikila njowo nofu yingi, yeseiwana na yila yemuwanuke suwe, munu uyo akotoliwe!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Wuli, mwihocha pendilonga makani aga ndisaka kuvakelesa vanu? Se ndakyene, ila ndikela kumkelesa Nguluvi na sekuvakelesa vanu. Ngita ndikali kugecha kuvakelesa vanu, senganivechile ng'odo mnyigendwa va Kilisito.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akemeliwe na Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Lukolo vangu, mwing'ang'wa kuchela kuva Njowo nofu yendivadalikile nene seikahumile kwa vanu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Nene sendiwanuke kwa munu ng'odo, vala sendiwulanichwe na munu. Yesu Kilisito mwene nde yeandigubutuliye nene.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Nyenye mupulike suwe pendikali ndikwikala na kuihecha hilo mung'asi lya kumfunya Nguluvi lya Kiyawudi, pendigudise lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito na kusaka kulihananga. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Ndikachidikile unofu malagilicho ga Vayawudi kuchumba Vayawudi vayangu veviwana na nene, kwakuva ndikali ndigangamala kuchikolela mawulanicho ga vagogolo vetu.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Ila kwa usanzi va Nguluvi, akanihagule pendave kubabwa, anikemelie ndimkumbanikile, <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Nguluvi akamuwonesa Mwana vake kwa nene, neke ndiwese kudalika Njowo nofu chake kwa vanu se Vayawudi. Nguluvi peandihaguwe nene kugita ndeni, nene sendikalongiye munu yoyonda lukani ulo, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />vala sendikahele ku Yelusalemu kuvalolela vala vevakali va kwanja kuvecha vanjagila, ila ndikahele tandi ku Alabuni, pambele ndikawuyile ku Damesiki. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Baho, pegichumbile miyaka gidatu ndikahele ku Yelusalemu kutang'ana na Peteli, ndikakalile kwa mwene figono kyumi na gihano. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Ukoya sendikamwene mnjagila yungi ila Yakobo, lukolo va Mtwa Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Nguluvi ichela sendilonga udesi na gendikuvasimbiliya ndi undakyene.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Pambele ndikahele pono cha Silia na Kilikia. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Muchipindi chila nene mwene ndikali sendichelwa kwa lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito ukoya ku Yudea. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Chevakali vichela ndi chila njowo hela chevakali vipulika, “Munu yula yeikali akutugudisa pamwandi, nondee akuvadalikila vanu ludikilo lula lula lweakali igecha kuihananga.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Suwe, navo vakamnjuma Nguluvi kwakuva lya nene.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Paulo na Vanjagila vangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Baho, pegichumbile miyaka kyumi na gitai, ndikahele kangi ku Yelusalemu pamwi na Balinaba na Tito. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Ndikahele kwakuva Nguluvi aniwonisile kuva nding'ang'wa kuhelela, neke ndikavalongile kwa ufiyo vala filongochi, unanzi va Njowo nofu chendidalike kwa vanu se Vayawudi. Ndikagitile ndeni, neke kasi lyangu yendikagitile na yila yendigita nondee chibihile kuyaga hela. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Ila ata muyangu Tito, mwene Mugiliki, filongochi avo sevamuswitiliche kudumula bina, <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />ata kukali na vakolo va udesi yevang'ang'ile adumulwe bina. Vanu ava vakaingile kwa lupwepo na kulolesa upekesu vetu tweunago kwa kwiwunga na Yesu Kilisito, neke vawese kutugita vasutu, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />setukuvadikile, neke undakyene va Njowo Nofu chisigale kwa nyenye.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Na vanu ava yevachelwa kuva filongochi, kwa nene sekinu, kwakuva Nguluvi seilolela makani ga kwivala, vanu ava sevakali na mahocho ga kunihongechela. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Ila filongochi ava vakawene kuva Nguluvi akanigavile kasi lya kudalika Njowo Nofu kwa vanu se Vayawudi, ngita fila peamulagiche Peteli kudalika Njowo Nofu kwa Vayawudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Kwakuva, yula yeamgavile Peteli umwimike va kuvecha mnjagila kwa Vayawudi, nde yula yula yeandigavile umwimike va kuvecha mnjagila kwa vanu se Vayawudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Suwe, Yakobo na Kefa na Yohani, vakawonike kuva filongochi vakomi vakachele kuva Nguluvi andigavile usangi, vakatukolele mawoko nene na Balinaba ngita kimanyilo kya kuwonesa tugehe pamwi. Vakadikile kuva nefwe tuhelele kwa vanu se Vayawudi na vene vahelele kwa Vayawudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Vakatusukile kuva tuendelele kuvawiwuka vahangala, nde lukani lyendikali ndigangamala kuligita.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akumlakilila Peteli ukoya mwani va Anitiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Ila Peteli peachile ku mwani va Anitiokia ndikampinjile pautalo lya vanu, kwakuva akali agitile nongwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Dahila, vanu vevahumile kwa Yakobo pevave kufika, Peteli akali iliya pamwi na vanu se Vayawudi. Ila avo vanu pevafikile akavangile kuyihecha na kuyinenga na vanu se Vayawudi, kwakuva akali akuvaogwipa vanu vevadumule bina. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Kangi Vayawudi vangi vakamdikile Peteli muufyangu ugo na Balinaba mwene akachangilwe na ufyangu ugo. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Pendiwene kuva sevagita ngita peing'ang'a Njowo Nofu, ndikamlongile Peteli pautalo lya vanu vonda, “Veve ndi Muyawudi, ila veve wikala ngita munu se Muyawudi. Wiwesa wuli kuvaswitilicha vanu se Vayawudi vakale ngita Vayawudi?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi na vanu se Vayawudi valowoliwa kwa kudikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Ndakyene, nefwe ndi Vayawudi kwa kubabwa na se ngita vanu va inyi yingi vene se Vayawudi vene sambi. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Ila nefwe tuchela kuva munu seigitwa kuva msanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa kukolela malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa, ila ugitwa msanzi kwa kumdikila Yesu Kilisito. Na nefwe tukumdikila Yesu Kilisito neke tugitwe vasanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa kuchumbila kumdikila Kilisito Yesu, vala se kukolela malagilicho, kwakuva kwa kukolela malagilicho kwehela munu daigitwa msanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Ila petusaka kugitwa vasanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito, nefwe tuwoneka kuva vene sambi, wuli lukani ulu liwoneka kuva Kilisito ndi mnyigendwa va sambi? Hamu! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Ila ngita ndichenga kangi kila kyenditunyule suwe, ndiwonesa kuva nene nde muhanganifu. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Kwakuva lya malagilicho ago, nene ndifuwe, neke ndiwese kwikala kwakuva lya Nguluvi. Nene ndivambilwe pakipindilihicho pamwi na Kilisito, <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />nondee se nene kangi yendikwikala ila Kilisito yeakwikala mugati lyangu. Nondee ndikala kwa kumdikila Mwana va Nguluvi, yeandikeliye na kuhecha uwumi vake kwakuva lya nene. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Sendiwesa kulema usanzi va Nguluvi. Ngita munu igitwa msanzi kwa kukolela malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa, suwe, Kilisito afuwe hela!<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Malagilicho awu Kudikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Nyenye vanu va Vagalatia vapufi! Ndia ani yeavahaviye? Njowo cha kuvambilwa pakipindilihicho kwa Yesu Kilisito chihumulilwe wachi pautalo lyenu. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Ndisaka kuchela kinu kimwi kuhuma kwa nyenye. Wuli, mukamuwanuke Muhe va Nguluvi kwa kukolela malagilicho awu kwa kuchidikila Njowo Nofu chemupulike? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Wuli, nyenye ndi vapufi ndeni? Nyenye mukavangile kwa utango va Muhe va Nguluvi, wuli musaka kumalila kwa ludali lwenu mwavene? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Wuli, makani gyonda gala gemugawanuke gikali gahela ng'ani? Hamu segakali gya hela! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Wuli, Nguluvi akuvagavila Muhe vake na kugita umanyitu pagati lyenu kwakuva mukolela malagilicho awu kwakuva mupulika Njowo Nofu na kwidikila?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Masimbo ga Nguluvi gisimbilwe ndeni, “Ibulahimu amudikiye Nguluvi na Nguluvi akamdikila ngita munu yeagita masanzi.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Nondee, muchele kuva vale vanu vevamudikila Kilisito, avo nde vana va Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Masimbo ga Nguluvi gasimbilwe kuva na mwene Nguluvi davagita vanu se Vayawudi kwa ng'asi lya ludikilo, akalonguwe kumlongela Ibulahimu Njowo chinofu, “Kuchumbila veve vanu va inyi chonda davafunywa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Suwe, vala vonda yemdikile Nguluvi vifunywa pamwi na Ibulahimu yeadikile.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Ila vonda yevahuvilila hela kugita geging'ang'wa na malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa, vakotoliwe. Masimbo ga Nguluvi gasimbilwe, “Yeyonda yeseikolela na kugita gyonda gala gegisimbilwe mu kiganulo kya malagilicho, akotoliwe!” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Ndakyene kwihela munu yeyonda yeigitwa msanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa kukolela malagilicho ga Nguluvi, kwakuva Masimbo ga Nguluvi gasimbilwe, “Munu yeakwikala kwa kudikila dakwikala.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Ila malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa segihuvilila ludikilo, ila masimbo ga Nguluvi gasimbilwe, “Munu yeikolela malagilicho daipata uwumi kwa kudikila malagilicho ago.”<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kilisito atukombuwe kuhuma muukotolo lya malagilicho ga Nguluvi yeamgaviye Musa kwa kutegula ukotolo uwo, kwakuva lyetu. Masimbo ga Nguluvi gasimbilwe, “Yeyonda yeavambilwe pakipindilihicho, akotoliwe.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Akatukombuwe neke lufunyo lweagavilwe Ibulahimu luvafikiye vanu se Vayawudi kwa kuchumbila Kilisito Yesu, neke kwa ludikilo tuwese kuwanuka yila jangila lya Muhe va Nguluvi.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa na jangila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Vakolo vangu, ndisaka ndivalongele mufanu va uwumi va kila kigono. Ngita fila kwihela munu yeiwesa kugalambula awu kongelecha kinu mulilagano lya vanu lyevapatine kwa kusimba. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Suwe, Ibulahimu akagavilwe jangila, mwene pamwi na ulelo vake. Masimbo ga Nguluvi segilonga, “Na valelo vake,” Kuwonesa vanu volofu, ila kwa ulelo vako kuwonesa munu yumwi, ndi Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Kyendisaka kulonga ndi kuva, Nguluvi agitile liagano na Ibulahimu, likagitilwe kwa chipindi chitali pegave kwacha malagilicho gyake gyeamgavie Musa, chikaachile miyaka mia na chitai na selasini pambele, suwe malagilicho ago sedagiwesa kugalambula jangila lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Kwakuva ngita fupo lya Nguluvi ihuvilila malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa, suwe seihuvilila kangi jangila, ila Nguluvi kwa usanzi vake akamgavile Ibulahimu fupo kwakuva akajangile.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Nondee, kwa liki kuveche na malagilicho ga Nguluvi cheamgavile Musa? Chikavikilwe neke kuwonesa uhanangifu ndi kinu liki, mbaka peakwacha yula yeatambuchwe mujangila. Malagilicho ga Nguluvi chikaletilwe na ndumindumi vake na Musa ichengakaya vanu na Nguluvi. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Ndakyene, mchengakaya seing'wang'wa kunjengakaya na munu yuwmi hela ngita munu yungi asupali, ila Nguluvi ndi yumwi.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Natilo lya malagilicho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Wuli, malagilicho chipinjana na jangila cha Nguluvi? Hamu! Suwe, ngita malagilicho ga Nguluvi ngaihecheliwe ngaiwesa kuvagavila vanu uwumi, suwe kila munu ngaivesa kugitwa msanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa ng'asi lya malagilicho. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Ila masimbo ga Nguluvi gasimbilwe suwe vanu vonda vagehe panyi lya ludali lwa sambi, neke gala gejangilwe kwa ng'asi lya kumdikila Yesu Kilisito gawese kugavilwa vala vevadikila.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Peyave kwacha ludikilo, tukali tuvikilwe panyi lya malagilicho, tudindilwe mbaka yila ludikilo igubutuliwe. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Ndeni, malagilicho ga Musa gakali gakutulongocha ngita mlelo vetu, mbaka Kilisito peachile, neke tuwese kugitwa vasanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa ludikilo. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Ila nondee kumdikila Kilisito kwachile suwe, setulongochwa kangi na malagilicho ga Musa.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Kwa kumdikila Kilisito, nyenye vonda muvechile vana va Nguluvi kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Kwakuva nyenye vonda yemubatisilwe mwiwungine na Kilisito, muvecha ngita mumfwalile Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Suwe, kwahela kangi tofwauti pagati lya Muyawudi na Mugiliki, msutu awu munu yealekeliwe pekesu, mgosi vala mdala, kwakuva vonda muvechile kinu kimwi kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Kwakuva nyenye ndi vanu va Kilisito, suwe, nyenye ndi valelo va Ibulahimu na vahala, damuwanuka fila fyajangile Nguluvi.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Suwe, ndilonga ndeni, muhala peave mwana, seihela tofwauti na msutu ata ngita finu fyonda fyake. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Mwene ivecha panyi lya valelo vake vakumlolela mbaka chipindi chekivikilwe na daada vake pechifika. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Ndeni ndeni na nefwe petukali ngita vana, chipindi Kilisito peave kwacha, tukali vasutu va makani gya muinyi. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Ila chipindi kyekipangilwe na Nguluvi pechifikile, akamlagiliche Mwana vake yeakali munu ngita nefwe na akachidikile malagilicho gya Musa, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />ili awese kuvakombola vala yevalongochwa na malagilicho neke nefwe tugitwe vana va Nguluvi.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Kwakuva nyenye ndi vana va Nguluvi, amulagiliche Muhe va Mwana vake munumbula chenu, Muhe yeivemba, “Aba,” Mana lyake ndi, “Daada.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Suwe, veve semsutu kangi, ila veve ndi mwana, kwakuva veve ndi mwana dawiwanuka fyonda Nguluvi fyeavakile vana vake.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwogofi va Paulo kwa Vagalatia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Dahila, pemukali semukumchela Nguluvi, mukali mkuvagumbanikila va valungulu se Nguluvi ndakyene. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Ila nondee, kwakuva mumchele Nguluvi awu tulonge muchelwa na Nguluvi, muwesa wuli kuwuya kangi kwa vala mihoka vahangala na vasosovafu ata kung'ang'wa kuvagumbanikila kangi? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Mwiginya lihungu mukigono na myechi na chipindi na miyaka! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ndihogofya kuva kasi ngomi chendikagitile kwakuva lya nyenye chikali chihela kinu!<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Vakolo vangu, ndikuvasuka muveche ngita nene, kwakuva nene ndivechile ngita nyenye. Semukandigitile lukani lunjanganifu. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Nyenye muchela kuva utamwa wendikali navo, nde kinu kyekinigavile muda va kuvadalikila nyenye Njowo Nofu, pamwandi. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Ata ngita pendikali mtamwa ndikavagaviye utatala, semukanibedile vala kunilema, ila mukaniwanuke ngita ndumindumi va Nguluvi, ngita fila Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Mukahekelela, nondee luhekelelo lwenu lugehe kwiya? Ndiwesa kuvecha mswida kuva, kwa chipindi chila ngamuwesa ata kuhecha meho gyenu na kundigavila nene. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Wuli, nondee ndivechile mchwindama venu kwa kuvalongela undakyene?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Avo vawulanichi vaudesi vikela kuvakelesa nyenye, ila natilo chawo se nofu. Visaka kuvanenga na nene neke nyenye muvapulikiche vene. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Ndi unofu kuvagumbanikila vanu vangi mufinu finofu na se hela chipindi nene ndigehe pamwi na nyenye. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Vana vangu, ngita fila maye yeagehe na lusololo peigudika chipindi kya kubaba, nene ndigudika kangi kwakuva lya nyenye mbaka kyanda kya Kilisito yiwoneke mu kyanda kyenu. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Ndidoboka kuvecha pamwi na nyenye nondee, ngandiwese kulonga na nyenye kwa ufokomasi. Ndigehe na wogofi na nyenye!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufano va Hajili na Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Munilongele, nyenye yemusaka kuvecha panyi lya malagilicho ga Nguluvi, wuli, muchela gyegilongwa mumalagilicho? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Kwakuva isimbilwe kuva Ibulahimu akali na vana vavili, yumwi va mdala msutu na yungi va mdala yeseagehe msutu. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Ila mwana va mdala msutu akababilwe ngita vanu vangi pevababilwe na yungi akababilwe ngita Nguluvi pemjangile Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Makani aga ngita mufanu, vamaye ava vavili ndi mufano va malagano gavili gegigitwe na Nguluvi na vanu vake. Hajili ndi ngita liagano lyeligitilwe na Nguluvi mukidunda kya Sinai. Liagano ilyo likavagitile vanu vaveche vasutu. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Suwe, Hajili awanine ngita kidunda kya Sinai, kyekigehe Alabuni na iwana ngita mwani va ku Yelusalemu ngita peugehe muinyi, kwakuva vana vake vagehe kuusutu mumalagilicho gyevagavilwe pakidunda Sinai. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Ila Sala, ikwima ngita Yelusalemu lya kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, ndi mdala yeagehe pekesu, mwene ndi maye vetu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Kwakuva masimbo ga Nguluvi gasimbilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">“Hekelele, veve yeugehe mgulumbafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">ubwate na lilumbililo kwa luhekelelo, veve seupatile lihingili lwa kubaba mwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">kwakuva vana va mdala yealekilwe ndi volofu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">kuchumba va yula yeagehe na mgosi.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Suwe, vakolo vangu, nefwe ndi vana va jangila lya Nguluvi ngita peagehe Isaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Ila mufigono fila, mwana yeababilwe ngita vanu vangi, akamgitiye ndeo yula yeababilwe kwa Muhe va Nguluvi, ndeni ndeni peigehe ata nondee. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Ila masimbo ga Nguluvi gasimbile liki? Gasimbilwe, “Muheche mdala msutu na mwana vake, kwakuva mwana va msutu seiwesa kuhala pamwi na mwana va yula mdala yegehe pekesu.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Kwa ndeni vakolo vangu, nefwe sevana va mdala msutu, ila ndi vana yula mdala yeagehe pekesu.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Twing'ang'wa kwikala ngita vanu pekesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Kilisito atugitile tuveche pekesu, akasakile tusigale pekesu. Suwe, muveche vakangafu mubihile kuvecha muusutu kangi. <verse eid="GAL 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Mupulikiche! Nene ndi Paulo ndikuvalongela nyenye kuva ngita mudikila kudumulwa bina, neke mdikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi, suwe muchele gala geagitile Kilisito kwakuva lya nyenye segakuvatanga kinu. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Ndikuvalongela kangi, yula yeadikila kudumulwa bina ikumng'ang'a akolele malagilicho gonda ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Nyenye yemusaka kugitwa vasanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi kwakuchidikila malagilicho munengilwe na Kilisito, mugehe kutali na usanzi va Nguluvi. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Ila nefwe, tuchindila kwa luhuvililo kwa umwimike va Muhe va Nguluvi neke tugitwe tudikilwe pautalo lyake kwa ng'asi ya kumdikila Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Ngita munu akwiwunga na Kilisito Yesu, aveche adumule bina awu seadumule bina kwihela sekinu, ila kinu ndi kudikila kwa veve nde kukugita uvakele vanu vangi.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Kyanda kyenu kikali kinofu! Ani yeavakanile mubihile kudikila undakyene? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Mawulanicho aga segahumile kwa Nguluvi yeavakemeliye. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Vanu vilonga, “Lisimika lidodo ligita utine vonda lihate!” <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Kwakuva nefwe tuwungine na Kilisito, nichela undakyene dasemufwata machowo ga vanu vangi, ila damufwata machowo gangu. Kangi munu yeyonda yeakuvanenga daihigwa na Nguluvi.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Ila vakolo vangu, ngita nene ndave ndikuvadalikila vanu vadumulwe bina, kwa liki ndave ndigudiswa na Vayawudi? Ngita ndave ndidalika kuva ing'ang'wa kudumula bina, suwe, kudalika kwa nene njowo cha kipindilihicho cha Kilisito ngasevavipile. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Nding'ang'a vanu avo vevakuvagudisa nyenye kwa makani gya kudumula bina, vaendelele kuvagita vabihile kubaba kangi.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Nyenye vakolo, mukemeliwe neke muveche pekesu. Ila upekesu uwo ubilihe kuvagita kufwata ludobokelo lwa mvili, ila muyigumbanikiye mwavene kwa lukelo. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Malagailicho gyonda cha Musa chigehe mulilagilicho limwi, “Mukele muyago ngita pewikwikela yumwene.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Ila ngita mukwiluma na kwidakula mwavene ngita vang'oko, muyilolele mubihile kwidocha mwavene.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Suwe, ndilonga ndeni, kyanda chenu chilongochwe na Muhe va Nguluvi, nyenye dasemudobokela kangi ludoboko lwa mvili. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Kwakuva ludobokelo lwa mvili chikwipinja na Muhe na Muhe upinjana na ludobokelo lwa mvili. Muhe va Nguluvi na mvili chikwipinja, ndeni semuwesa kugita gala gemwisaka mwavene. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Ila ngita mukilongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi, suwe dasemuvecha vasutu va malagilicho ga Nguluvi gemgavile Musa.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Suwe, magito ga inyi ndi aga, usasi na ugoni na kugita njowo cha nyoni kwa vanu, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />kugundamila ming'omong'omo, uhavi na uchundwama na ndewo na wifu na luvipo na wimi na kuvagita vanu vayilumbane na kuyinenga fipinga na kuvanenga vangi, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />kudobokela na ugala na kuliya kuno ugwite na makani gangi gegiwana na ago. Ndikuvalakilila, ngita pendivalakilile pamwandi, vanu vevigita makani ngita ago, daseviupata ung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi uveche vawo.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Ila pewilongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi dawivecha na lukelo na lukeduko na lutengamaso na luhuvililo na usanzi na kuveche munu va kuvatanga vangi na kwikala ngajila lukolakola, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />ufokomasi na kuyilongocha. Kwihela malagilicho yeiwesa kulonga makani aga ndi mawofu. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Vanu vonda vevagehe na Kilisito Yesu vavambilwe pakipindilihicho uwumi vawo va kimvili pamwi na mahocho gake ganjanganifu na ludoboko chake. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Muhe va Nguluvi atugavile uwumi, ndeni ndeni tumleke alongoche uwumi vetu. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Suwe, tubihile kwinjuma, tubihile kwivipisa vala kuyiwonela wifu.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Twihuvilile na kwitanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Vakolo vangu, ngita muyenu akigita sambi, suwe, nyenye yemulongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi mumlakilila munu uyo kwa ufokomasi neke aleke sambi, ila muyilolele neke na nyenye mubihile kugita sambi. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Ngita yumwi venu ngaipata utatala mwitange, kwa kugita ndeni mukigita ngita peing'ang'a malagilicho ga Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Ngita munu akwiwona kuva mwene ndi ngiba kuchumba mweyage na kuno sendeni, akwichanga mwene. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Ila kila munu yumwi ayilolele unofu kyanda lyake, ngita nofu suwe iwesa kwinjuma ngajila kwiwananisa na munu yungi. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Kwakuva, kila munu daihombwa kwa gala gyeagitile.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Suwe, yeiwulanichwa luchowo lwa Nguluvi ing'ang'wa kumlongela manofu muwalanichi vake.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Mubihile kwichanga, kwihela munu yeiwesa kufiya kyokyonda pautalo lya Nguluvi. Kwakuva kila cheivyala munu nde daibena. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Ngita ugita ludobeko lwako cha inyi daubena kufuwa. Ila ngita dawifata gala gye ikela Muhe va Nguluvu dawipata uwumi va mbepali. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Suwe, petugita manofu ngajila kufwaila na petubihila kutwenyeka numbulau, datwibena mabenolo kwa chipindi kyake. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Kila petupatila fwasi tuvagitile vanu vonda makani ganofu, hilo kwa vala vevamudikile Kilisito ngita nefwe.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akuvalakilila na kuvahungila Vagalatia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Mulolele pendikuvasimbiliya masimbo makomi kwa liwoko lyangu yune! <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Vala veving'ang'a vawonike vanofu kwa makani ga inyi, avo vakuvang'ang'a nyenye mudumulwe bina. Vigita ndeni, neke vene vabihile kugudika kwakuva lya kipindilihicho kya Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Ata vala vevadumulwe bina sevadikila malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa, ila vakuvang'ang'a nyenye mudumulwe bina neke vapate kwinjuma kwa makani gya mivili gyenu. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ila nene sendikwidumbila kinu kyokyonda ng'odo, ila ndikudumbila kufuwa kya Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito pakipindilihicho, kwakuva lya kufuwa kwamwene makani gyonda gya inyi iyi se kinu kwa nene na uwumi vangu va daila gafuwe pamwi na mwene pakipindilihicho. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Kwakuva kudumula bina awu ngajila kudumula bina sekinu, ila kinu kuvecha kiwumbe kimiya. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Lutengamaso na lusungu yeihuma kwa Nguluvi iveche na vanu vonda vevakufwata undakyene ugo avo nde vanu va Nguluvi.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Suwe, nondee munu yeyonda abihile kunigudisa kangi, kwakuva nene ndigehe na migumba mumvili vangu kwakuva lya kumgumbanikila Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Vakolo vangu, usanzi va Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito uveche pamwi na nyenye vonda. Ndakyene.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>